      <section id="shopify-section-template--21732444995724__main" class="shopify-section shopify-section--main-page"><div class="section-spacing section-spacing--tight color-scheme color-scheme--scheme-ed33a2b6-9183-44ba-aa66-49321d9bae1c color-scheme--bg-f733170f8e26ef0af87b024124e087d4">
  <div class="container container--xs">
    <div class="section-stack"><div class="section-header justify-self-center text-center">
          <h1 class="h2">Privacy Policy — Cleo Lifestyle (Android)</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="prose"><div><strong>Last updated: 02 July 2026</strong></div>

<div>
<span>This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>Cleo Home LLC</strong>, trading as </span><strong>Cleo Lifestyle</strong>Cleo," "we," "us," or "our"), collects, uses, and protects your information when you use the <strong>Cleo Lifestyle</strong> app (the "App") for Android. It does not cover thecleolifestyle.com online store or other services, which are governed by their own notices. (The iOS app has its own policy.)</div>

<div><span>By using the App you agree to this Policy. If you do not agree, please do not use the App.</span></div>

<div><strong>At a glance</strong></div>

<div><span>- <strong>The App works mostly on your device.</strong> Your rituals, streak, points, dosha result,  bookmarks, and settings are stored <strong>locally on your phone</strong> — not on our servers.</span></div>
<div><span>- <strong>You need an account</strong> to use the App. We use <strong>Sign in with Google</strong> and receive only  your <strong>name and email</strong>.</span></div>
<div><span>- <strong>Marketing is opt-in and off by default. </strong>We only copy your profile off your device   to our marketing list <strong>if you switch it on</strong>. You can turn it off, or delete everything,  at any time in<strong> Settings → Settings &amp; Privacy</strong>.</span></div>
<div><span>- <strong>We do not run ads, ad-tracking, analytics SDKs, or session recording</strong>, and we<strong> do</strong><strong>  not sell your personal information</strong>.</span></div>

<div><strong>1. Who we are (Data Controller)</strong></div>

<div><span>The data controller responsible for your information is:</span></div>

<div><span>&gt; <strong>Cleo Home LLC</strong> (Cleo Lifestyle)</span></div>
<div>
<span>&gt;</span><span> 30 N Gould St Ste, Sheridan, Wyoming 82801, United States</span>
</div>
<div>
<span>&gt;</span><span> Email: </span><strong>Hello@cleo-home.com</strong>
</div>

<div><span>For privacy questions or to exercise your rights, contact us at <strong>Hello@cleo-home.com</strong>.</span></div>

<div><strong> 2. Information we collect</strong></div>

<div><span><strong> a. Account information (when you sign in)</strong>To use the App you sign in with Google. From that sign-in we receive your <strong>name </strong>and <strong>email address</strong>, and a record of when you joined. We never receive or store your Google password.</span></div>
<div><strong>b. Information stored on your device</strong></div>
<div><span>As you use the App it stores the following <strong>locally on your device</strong>. By default this information stays on your device and is not transmitted to us:</span></div>

<div><span>- Your dosha (Ayurvedic body-type) quiz result;</span></div>
<div><span>- Ritual activity — bottle fills, water logged, daily "dinacharya" check-ins;</span></div>
<div><span>- Streak, loyalty points, and total rituals;</span></div>
<div><span>- Bookmarks and eBook reading progress;</span></div>
<div><span>- App settings and reminder times (theme, sound, fill/drink times, etc.).</span></div>

<div><strong>c. Marketing-list information (only if you opt in)</strong></div>
<div><span>If you turn on <strong>"Marketing &amp; updates"</strong><strong> </strong>(off by default), we copy a snapshot of your profile to our marketing list so we can send you relevant tips, content, and offers.That snapshot contains:</span></div>

<div><span>- Name and email;</span></div>
<div><span>- Dosha, hydration style, and onboarding status;</span></div>
<div><span>- Streak, total rituals, and points;</span></div>
<div><span>- Date you joined and last-active date;</span></div>
<div><span>- Timezone, device platform (e.g. "android"), and App version;</span></div>
<div><span>- Your consent status and the policy version you agreed to.</span></div>

<div><span>Some of this (for example your <strong>dosha</strong> and hydration habits) relates to your wellness. We treat it with care and only collect, sync, or use it for marketing <strong>with your explicit consent</strong>, which you can withdraw at any time.</span></div>
<div><strong>d. Information collected automatically</strong></div>
<div><span>We deliberately keep this to a minimum. The App contains<strong> no analytics, advertising,attribution, or crash-reporting SDKs, and uses no advertising identifier.</strong> When the App connects to the internet to sync your marketing list (only if you opted in) or to load content such as product images, eBooks, or podcast links, the receiving server may process standard technical data such as your **IP address** and device/network information, as is inherent to any internet request. We do not use this to track you across apps or websites.</span></div>

<div><strong>e. What we do not collect</strong></div>
<div><span>We do not collect your precise location, contacts, calendar, photos, biometric data,health records, or any advertising/cross-app identifiers, and we do not record your screen or sessions.</span></div>

<div><strong>3. How we use your information</strong></div>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Purpose</th>
      <th>Data used</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
