    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<div><span>We do <strong>not</strong> use your information for automated decision-making that produces legal orsimilarly significant effects, and we do <strong>not</strong> sell or rent your personal information.</span></div>

<div><strong>4. Legal bases for processing (EEA / UK)</strong></div>

<div><span>Where the GDPR or UK GDPR applies, we rely on:</span></div>

<div><span>- <strong>Consent</strong> — for adding you to our marketing list and sending you marketing   communications, and for processing wellness-related information such as your dosha.   You may withdraw consent at any time (see Section 7).</span></div>
<div><span>- <strong>Performance of a contract</strong>  — to provide the App and your account.</span></div>
<div><span>- <strong>Legitimate interests</strong> — to keep the App secure and prevent abuse, balanced against  your rights.</span></div>
<div><span>- <strong>Legal obligation  </strong>— where we must process data to comply with the law.</span></div>

<div><strong>5. Consent and your choices</strong></div>

<div><span>- Marketing collection is <strong>opt-in and off by default</strong>. Nothing leaves your device for  marketing unless you turn it on.</span></div>
<div><span>- You can <strong>turn it off at any time</strong>in <strong>Settings → Settings &amp; Privacy → Marketing &amp;</strong></span></div>
<div><span><strong>  updates</strong>. When you turn it off, we remove your profile from our marketing list.</span></div>
<div><span>- You can <strong>delete your account and data</strong> in the same screen ("Delete account"). This   wipes your local data and removes your profile from our marketing list.</span></div>
<div><span>- Declining or withdrawing marketing consent does <strong>not </strong>prevent you from using the App.</span></div>

<div><strong>6. How we share information</strong></div>

<div><span>We do not sell your personal information. We share it only as follows:</span></div>

<div>
<span>- <strong>Service providers (processors)</strong> who help us run the App, under contract and only as  needed:  </span><span>- <strong>Google LLC</strong> — Sign in with Google, and the cloud service we use to store the  marketing list;  </span><span>- any email/marketing provider we engage to send communications you have consented to.</span>
</div>
<div><span>- <strong>Linked services you choose to open</strong> — the App links out to our store on  <a href="/" target="_blank">cleolifestyle.com</a> (hosted by Shopify) and to our podcast on <strong>Spotify</strong><strong>.</strong> When you   open these, you interact with those third parties under <strong>their</strong>privacy policies.</span></div>
<div><span>- <strong>Legal and safety</strong> — where required by law, regulation, legal process, or to protect   rights, safety, and security.</span></div>
<div><span>- <strong>Business transfers</strong> — in connection with a merger, acquisition, or sale of assets   subject to this Policy.</span></div>

<div><strong> *Note: our marketing list is currently stored using Google's cloud services. If we change providers, we will update this Policy.*</strong></div>

<div><strong>7. Your rights</strong></div>

<div><span>Depending on where you live, you may have some or all of the following rights:</span></div>

<div><span>- <strong>Access</strong> a copy of your personal information;</span></div>
<div><span>- <strong>Rectify</strong> inaccurate information;</span></div>
<div><span>- <strong>Erase</strong> your information ("right to be forgotten");</span></div>
<div><span>- <strong>Restrict</strong> or <strong>object</strong><strong> </strong>to processing;</span></div>
<div><span>- <strong>Data portability</strong>;</span></div>
<div><span>- &lt;<strong>Withdraw consent</strong> at any time (without affecting prior processing);</span></div>
<div><span>- <strong>Lodge a complaint</strong> with your data protection authority.</span></div>

<div><span>You can exercise the core rights directly in the App (withdraw marketing consent; delete your account and data). For any other request, email <strong>Hello@cleo-home.com</strong>. We will respond within the timeframe required by applicable law.</span></div>

<div>
<strong>California (CCPA/CPRA):</strong><span> you have the right to know, delete, and correct your personal information, and to opt out of "sale" or "sharing" — <strong>we do not sell or share</strong>personal information as those terms are defined, and we will not discriminate against you for exercising your rights.<strong>EEA / UK (GDPR):</strong> you may complain to your local supervisory authority.</span>
</div>
<div>
<strong>Other regions:</strong><span> if you are located outside the United States, local data-protection laws may give you additional rights; email <strong>Hello@cleo-home.com</strong> to exercise them.</span>
</div>

<div><strong>8. International data transfers</strong></div>

<div><span>We are based in the United States, and our service providers (such as Google) may process data in other countries, including the United States. Where we transfer personal data internationally, we rely on appropriate safeguards required by applicable law (such as standard contractual clauses or an adequacy determination).</span></div>

<div><strong>9. Data retention</strong></div>

<div><span>- <strong>On-device data</strong> remains until you delete your account or uninstall the App.</span></div>
<div><span>- <strong>Marketing-list data</strong> is kept until you opt out, delete your account, or it is no   longer needed, after which it is removed from the active list.</span></div>
<div><span>- <strong>Consent records</strong> (what you agreed to and when) may be retained longer where needed as proof of compliance.</span></div>

<div><strong>10. Security</strong></div>

<div><span>We use reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect your information, including encryption in transit (HTTPS) for any data sent off your device, access controls on our marketing list, and data minimisation. No method of transmission or storage is 100% secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.</span></div>

<div><strong>11. Children's privacy</strong></div>

<div><span>The App is not directed to children under <strong>13 </strong>, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from them. If you believe a child has provided us personal information, contact <strong>Hello@cleo-home.com</strong> and we will delete it.</span></div>

<div><strong>12. Push notifications</strong></div>

<div><span>If you enable reminders, the App may send you notifications (for example, fill/drink-water reminders). You can turn these off at any time in your device settings. We do not usenotifications to collect additional personal information.</span></div>

<div><strong>13. Third-party links</strong></div>

<div><span>The App links to third-party services, including our store on cleolifestyle.com (Shopify) and our podcast on Spotify. We are not responsible for their privacy practices; pleasereview their policies before providing information to them.</span></div>

<div><strong>14. Changes to this Policy</strong></div>

<div><span>We may update this Policy from time to time. When we make material changes, we will update the "Last updated" date and, where appropriate, ask for your consent again within the App.</span></div>

<div><strong>15. Contact us</strong></div>

<div>
<strong>Cleo Home LLC</strong><span> (Cleo Lifestyle)</span>
</div>
<div><span>30 N Gould St Ste, Sheridan, Wyoming 82801, United States</span></div>
